<title>USA: Thyssen extends tender offer for Giddings.</title>
<headline>Thyssen extends tender offer for Giddings.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Thyssen AG said 96 percent of shares in Giddings &amp; Lewis, a Wisconsin based auto parts manufacturer, have been tendered to Thyssen and that it has extended the time limit for remaining shareholders to do the same.</p>
<p>In a statement, Thyssen, a German conglomerate with $26 billion in annual revenues,  said the time limit was extended to 1700 EDT/2200 GMT Wednesday, July 30.  The original time limit was 1700 EDT/2200 GMT Wednesday, July 16.</p>
</text>
